            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# WindowHop 1.0.5

- Fix Dock previews collapsing into a narrow strip after the compact panel update.
- Give the preview content an explicit viewport so its flexible grid cannot shrink the panel.
- Keep the smaller Dock background and smooth opening fade.

Apple Silicon, macOS 13 or later. This free build is not Apple-notarized.
]]></description>
